{"Aspect ratio", "画面比例"},
{"Unlocked: the view fills the window, so wider (or taller) windows show more of the island - up to ultrawide; houses and dungeons keep their framing. Original 16:9: the game's own framing, with bars.", "铺满：画面填满窗口，因此更宽（或更高）的窗口会显示更多岛屿——最大支持超宽屏；房屋和地下城保持原有构图。原始 16:9：保持游戏原有构图，并显示黑边。"},
