{"Fills the screen. Also: F11, Alt+Enter or Cmd+Ctrl+F.", "填满屏幕。快捷键：F11、Alt+Enter 或 Cmd+Ctrl+F。"},
{"Show FPS", "显示帧率"},
{"Shows the frame rate in the top right corner.", "在右上角显示帧率。"},
{"Rendering", "渲染"},
{"Match display", "匹配屏幕"},
{"Dynamic", "动态"},
{"How sharp the 3D image is. Match display: your screen's own resolution. Dynamic: as sharp as your GPU keeps at full speed. 1x-4x: the Switch's 1080p times that. 75%% / 50%% / 25%%: a share of the display, for slower machines.\n\nRendering at %.0f x %.0f.", "3D 画面的清晰度。匹配屏幕：使用屏幕自身分辨率。动态：在 GPU 满速运行的前提下尽可能清晰。1x-4x：Switch 1080p 的倍数。75%% / 50%% / 25%%：显示分辨率的一定比例，适合较慢的设备。\n\n当前渲染：%.0f x %.0f。"},
{" Dynamic: %.0f%% of the display right now.", " 动态：当前为屏幕的 %.0f%%。"},
{"Internal resolution", "内部渲染分辨率"},
{"Bilinear", "双线性"},
{"How the image is scaled up to the window when it renders at a lower resolution. MetalFX: Apple's upscaler, sharper. Bilinear: plain and soft.", "当以较低分辨率渲染时，画面如何放大到窗口。MetalFX：Apple 的放大算法，更清晰。双线性：简单柔和。"},
{"How the image is scaled up to the window when it renders at a lower resolution. AMD FSR 1: edge-aware upscaling and sharpening, sharper. Bilinear: plain and soft.", "当以较低分辨率渲染时，画面如何放大到窗口。AMD FSR 1：边缘感知放大与锐化，更清晰。双线性：简单柔和。"},
{"%s\n\nNot used at Match display: the game already renders at your display's resolution.", "%s\n\n“匹配屏幕”时不使用：游戏已按屏幕分辨率渲染。"},
{"Upscaler", "放大算法"},
{"Anti-aliasing", "抗锯齿"},
{"Smooths jagged edges of the game image before it is scaled to the window. SMAA: finds the edges and blends only along them, so textures stay sharp. Most useful at a lower internal resolution.", "在画面放大到窗口之前平滑游戏画面的锯齿边缘。SMAA：只检测边缘并沿边缘混合，因此纹理保持清晰。在较低内部渲染分辨率下最有用。"},
