{"Delete seed + saves", "删除种子 + 存档"},
{"Spoiler log", "剧透日志"},
{"Copy seed ID", "复制种子 ID"},
{"Rename", "重命名"},
{"Start with Sword", "初始携带剑"},
{"Link starts with the sword. Off: it's placed in the world, with logic.", "林克初始携带剑。关闭：剑会按逻辑放置在世界中。"},
{"Start with Shield", "初始携带盾"},
{"Link starts with the shield. Off: it's placed in the world, with logic.", "林克初始携带盾。关闭：盾会按逻辑放置在世界中。"},
{"Start with Ocarina and Manbo's Mambo", "初始携带陶笛和曼波曼波曲"},
{"Link starts with the Ocarina and Manbo's Mambo, ready to warp. Off: both are placed in the world, with logic.", "林克初始携带陶笛和曼波曼波曲，可直接传送。关闭：两者会按逻辑放置在世界中。"},
{"Treat Tunics as Upgrades", "外衣视为升级"},
{"The red and blue tunics add up instead of replacing each other: the blue one always halves the damage Link takes, the red one always strengthens his attacks, and with both he has both.", "红色和蓝色外衣效果叠加而非互相替换：蓝色外衣始终将林克受到的伤害减半，红色外衣始终强化他的攻击，同时拥有则两种效果都有。"},
{"Check tracker on overworld map", "大地图上的检查点追踪"},
{"The overworld map marks the checks you have and haven't done yet.", "大地图会标记你已完成和尚未完成的检查点。"},
{"New seed", "新种子"},
{"Seed name", "种子名称"},
{"The seed's name (its folder). Leave it empty for a random one.", "种子名称（即其文件夹）。留空则随机生成。"},
{"Seed ID", "种子 ID"},
{"A seed ID holds the random seed and every option below: the same ID on the same LAS Recomp version makes the same seed. Enter a shared ID here to load its options.", "种子 ID 包含随机种子和下方所有选项：相同版本 LAS Recomp 上的相同 ID 会生成相同的种子。在此输入分享的 ID 可载入其选项。"},
{"Loaded: the options are set from this ID.", "已载入：选项已根据此 ID 设置。"},
{"Copies the seed ID above, to share the seed.", "复制上方的种子 ID，以便分享该种子。"},
{"New seed ID", "新种子 ID"},
{"A new random seed with the same options.", "使用相同选项生成新的随机种子。"},
{"Items", "道具"},
{"Shuffled", "打乱"},
{"Start with stone beaks", "初始携带石像鸟嘴"},
{"Start with maps + compasses", "初始携带地图 + 指南针"},
{"Start with all three", "初始携带全部三种"},
{"Dungeon items", "地下城道具"},
{"Maps, compasses and stone beaks: shuffled into the item pool, or given at the start.", "地图、指南针和石像鸟嘴：打乱进道具池，或在开始时给予。"},
{"Bombs must be found first", "必须先找到炸弹"},
{"Bombs are an item in the pool: until you find them, shops don't sell bombs and none drop.", "炸弹是道具池中的道具：在找到它之前，商店不出售炸弹，也不会掉落。"},
{"Magic Powder must be found first", "必须先找到魔法粉"},
{"Magic Powder is an item in the pool: until you find it, none can be bought or found.", "魔法粉是道具池中的道具：在找到它之前，无法购买或获得。"},
{"Few", "少量"},
{"Several", "若干"},
{"Many", "大量"},
{"Trapsanity", "陷阱模式"},
{"Traps", "陷阱"},
{"How many traps hide among the items.", "道具中隐藏的陷阱数量。"},
{"Up to 5", "最多 5"},
{"Up to 15", "最多 15"},
{"Up to 30", "最多 30"},
{"Up to 40", "最多 40"},
{"All (50)", "全部（50）"},
{"Seashell Mansion rewards", "贝壳公馆奖励"},
{"Which of the Seashell Mansion's rewards can hold important items: up to how many seashells.", "贝壳公馆的哪些奖励可以包含重要道具：最多需要多少枚贝壳。"},
{"Starting rupees", "初始卢比"},
{"Rupees in Link's wallet at the start.", "开始时林克钱包中的卢比。"},
{"Extra checks", "额外检查点"},
{"Every bush on the island hides an item from the pool (about 310 more checks; bushes over a hole and tall grass stay as they are). Unchecked bushes are golden: cut one to reveal its item.", "岛上的每个灌木丛都藏有道具池中的道具（约多 310 个检查点；洞上方的灌木和高草保持不变）。未检查的灌木显示为金色：砍掉一个即可显现道具。"},
{"INSANE: every diggable tile on the overworld is a check - about 5,000 more, and most important items end up buried. The first dig of a tile brings its item up; grass and bushes have to be cut first. Holes stay dug, so you can see where you've been.", "疯狂：大地图上每个可挖掘的地块都是检查点——约多 5,000 个，大多数重要道具会被埋在地下。地块第一次挖掘会挖出道具；草和灌木需要先砍掉。洞会保持挖开状态，因此你能看到走过的地方。"},
{"Small keys", "小钥匙"},
{"Small + Nightmare", "小钥匙 + 噩梦"},
{"All dungeon items", "所有地下城道具"},
{"Dungeon keys (and with the last choice every dungeon item) can be anywhere in the world, with logic. A key always opens doors in the dungeon it belongs to; with keysanity the Items screen shows each dungeon's keys.", "地下城钥匙（选择最后一项时还包括所有地下城道具）可以按逻辑出现在世界任何地方。钥匙始终能打开其所属地下城的门；开启钥匙随机化后，道具界面会显示每个地下城的钥匙。"},
{"Every liftable pot in houses, caves and dungeons hides an item from the pool (about 400 more checks). Unchecked pots are golden: lift, smash or throw one to reveal its item.", "房屋、洞窟和地下城中每个可举起的罐子都藏有道具池中的道具（约多 400 个检查点）。未检查的罐子显示为金色：举起、砸碎或扔出一个即可显现道具。"},
{"Vanilla prices", "原版价格"},
{"Random prices", "随机价格"},
{"Every good in the Mabe Village shop is a check: the shield, hearts, shovel, bow, arrows, bombs, the seven chamber stones and the piece of heart. Buy it, or steal it (the shopkeeper remembers a thief).", "玛贝村的商店里每件商品都是检查点：盾、心、铲子、弓、箭、炸弹、七块房间石和心之碎片。购买或偷走（店主会记住小偷）。"},
{"Trendy Game prizes", "潮流游戏奖品"},
{"Each of the 5 crane prize spots holds a check; won spots then hold ordinary prizes.", "抓娃娃机的 5 个奖品位置各有一个检查点；赢取后变为普通奖品。"},
{"Fishing prizes", "钓鱼奖品"},
{"The fishing pond's prizes hold items from the pool.", "钓鱼池的奖品包含道具池中的道具。"},
{"Rapids race prizes", "激流竞赛奖品"},
{"The Rapids Ride race's prizes hold items from the pool.", "激流勇进竞赛的奖品包含道具池中的道具。"},
{"Dampe's rewards", "丹培的奖励"},
{"Dampe's Chamber Dungeon challenge rewards hold items from the pool.", "丹培的房间地下城挑战奖励包含道具池中的道具。"},
{"Trade quest gifts", "交易任务礼物"},
{"The trade quest characters' gifts hold items from the pool.", "交易任务角色的礼物包含道具池中的道具。"},
{"Color Dungeon Blupees", "色彩地下城的蓝色精灵"},
{"The Color Dungeon's blupees hold items from the pool.", "色彩地下城的蓝色精灵包含道具池中的道具。"},
{"World", "世界"},
{"Entrance randomizer", "入口随机化"},
{"Shuffles where entrances lead, with logic.", "按逻辑打乱入口通向的位置。"},
{"Dungeon entrances", "地下城入口"},
{"Dungeon entrances lead into other dungeons.", "地下城入口通向其他地下城。"},
{"Single-entrance interiors and connector caves (two or three doors) are shuffled. Marin & Tarin's house and water entrances stay vanilla.", "单入口室内和连接洞窟（两到三扇门）会被打乱。玛林与塔林的家以及水域入口保持原版。"},
{"Decoupled entrances", "解耦入口"},
{"With Houses & caves: leaving a house puts you outside a different door than the one you came in by.", "配合“房屋与洞窟”：离开房屋时，你会从与进入时不同的门出来。"},
{"With the entrance randomizer on, at least one kind of entrance must be shuffled.", "开入口随机化时，至少需要打乱一种入口。"},
{"Dungeon room shuffle", "地下城房间打乱"},
{"Experimental. Rebuilds the dungeons (all but Eagle's Tower) from shuffled rooms; boss, mini-boss, stairs and other key rooms stay put.", "实验性。用打乱的房间重建地下城（鹰之塔除外）；首领、小首领、楼梯和其他关键房间保持原位。"},
{"Coherent", "连贯"},
{"Rooms connect north / south / east / west like they look, and the dungeon map is right.", "房间按外观连接南/北/东/西，地下城地图正确。"},
{"Chaos", "混沌"},
{"Any doorway can lead to any doorway of the dungeon. Every room is used once.", "任何门都可能通向该地下城的任何门。每个房间只使用一次。"},
{"Madness", "疯狂"},
{"Chaos with decoupled doors: going back through the door you came in by takes you somewhere else.", "混沌加解耦门：从进入的门返回会通向别处。"},
{"Map tracks door connections", "地图显示门连接"},
{"Matching letters (A-A, B-B...) on the dungeon map show which doorways connect: a pair appears once you've been through either end, and every pair of the dungeon once you have its map.", "地下城地图上相同的字母（A-A、B-B……）表示哪些门相连：走过任一端后会出现一对，拥有地图后会显示该地下城的所有配对。"},
{"Shuffle instruments", "打乱乐器"},
{"The Siren Instruments are items in the pool instead of each dungeon's reward.", "塞壬乐器成为道具池中的道具，而不是每个地下城的奖励。"},
{"Open Mabe Village", "开放玛贝村"},
{"Mabe Village's paths are open from the start.", "玛贝村的道路从一开始就开放。"},
{"Randomize environments", "随机环境"},
{"Each area gets another area's lighting and atmosphere (cosmetic).", "每个区域获得其他区域的光照和氛围（仅外观）。"},
{"Enemies & bosses", "敌人与首领"},
{"Randomize enemies", "随机敌人"},
{"Enemies are shuffled around the island.", "敌人被随机分布到岛上各处。"},
{"Include mini-bosses", "包含小首领"},
{"Some overworld enemies become mini-bosses: Hinox, Armos Knight, Dodongo Snake, Giant Buzz Blob, Smasher, Avalaunch, Rolling Bones, Cue Ball, Blaino, Master Stalfos, Moblin Chief or Lanmola.", "一些大地图敌人会变成小首领：Hinox、Armos Knight、Dodongo Snake、Giant Buzz Blob、Smasher、Avalaunch、Rolling Bones、Cue Ball、Blaino、Master Stalfos、Moblin Chief 或 Lanmola。"},
{"Boss souls", "首领灵魂"},
{"Each dungeon boss (and the Color Dungeon's) has a soul hidden among the items. Until you find it the boss isn't in its lair: the way on to the instrument stays shut until the boss is beaten. Found souls show on the Items screen.", "每个地下城首领（以及色彩地下城首领）都有一个灵魂藏在道具中。在找到它之前，首领不会出现在巢穴中：通往乐器的道路会封闭，直到击败首领。已找到的灵魂会显示在道具界面。"},
{"Mini-boss souls", "小首领灵魂"},
{"Each kind of dungeon mini-boss has a soul hidden among the items; one soul counts for every fight with that kind. Until you find it the mini-boss doesn't show up and its room's way on stays shut.", "每种地下城小首领都有一个灵魂藏在道具中；一个灵魂适用于与该种类的所有战斗。在找到它之前，小首领不会出现，其房间的出口也会封闭。"},
{"Defeating enemies in a row never drops a Guardian Acorn or a Piece of Power.", "连续击败敌人时不会掉落守护者橡果或力量碎片。"},
{"Companions", "同伴"},
{"The Flying Rooster is an item: found, he follows you. The logic counts him wherever he can stand in for the feather or hookshot.", "飞鸡是道具：找到后它会跟随你。在它能替代羽毛或钩索的地方，逻辑会将其计算在内。"},
{"The Ghost is an item: found, walk him to his grave for its check. He no longer appears by himself after the Surf Harp.", "幽灵是道具：找到后，带它到它的坟墓以获得检查点。获得冲浪竖琴后它不再自行出现。"},
{"Marin is an item in the pool, and the desert stays closed until you find her.", "玛林是道具池中的道具，在找到她之前沙漠保持封闭。"},
{"Companions allowed in dungeons", "允许同伴进入地下城"},
{"BowWow, the Rooster and the others follow Link into dungeons; the logic counts what they can do there.", "BowWow、飞鸡和其他同伴会跟随林克进入地下城；逻辑会计算它们在那里能做什么。"},
{"Other", "其他"},
{"The Hookshot latches onto any wall or object it hits, not only hookshot targets. The logic counts the gaps this crosses. Seeds made with it always have Hookshot Anything on.", "钩索可以抓住它碰到的任何墙壁或物体，而不只是钩索目标。逻辑会计算由此跨越的缺口。使用此选项的种子始终开启“钩索任意抓取”。"},
{"Fast songs", "快速歌曲"},
{"Learning a song skips its cutscene.", "学习歌曲时跳过其过场动画。"},
{"Boss cutscenes", "首领过场"},
{"Bosses' intro cutscenes play.", "播放首领的登场过场动画。"},
{"Randomize music", "随机音乐"},
{"The game's music tracks are shuffled.", "游戏音乐曲目被打乱。"},
{"Writes where every item is, to read from the seed's Spoiler log.", "记录每个道具的位置，可在种子的剧透日志中查看。"},
{"Generate seed", "生成种子"},
{"Makes a seed with these options. It shows up under Seeds, ready to play.", "使用这些选项生成种子。它会出现在“种子”下，可直接游玩。"},
{"< Back", "< 返回"},
{"Spoiler log - %s", "剧透日志 - %s"},
{"No readable spoiler for this seed yet. Generate it with: tools/rando/spoiler_view.py rando/%s", "此种子还没有可读的剧透。请使用以下命令生成：tools/rando/spoiler_view.py rando/%s"},
{"This shows where every item is, plus a step-by-step route to beat the seed.", "显示每个道具的位置，以及通关该种子的分步路线。"},
{"Reveal spoilers", "显示剧透"},
{"search (item, place...)", "搜索（道具、地点...）"},
{"Search the spoiler log", "搜索剧透日志"},
