{"Quick", "快捷"},
{"Max out everything", "全部最大化"},
{"Every heart, item, upgrade, song, instrument and dungeon key, full ammo, 999 rupees, all 50 Secret Seashells and 5 Golden Leaves.\n\nThe hearts on the HUD update after the next screen change.", "所有心、道具、升级、歌曲、乐器、地下城钥匙、满弹药、999 卢比、全部 50 个秘密贝壳和 5 片金色叶子。\n\n状态栏的心形会在下次切换画面后更新。"},
{"Refill hearts & ammo", "回满生命和弹药"},
{"Refills health, and the bombs, arrows and Magic Powder Link owns.", "回满生命值，以及林克拥有的炸弹、箭和魔法粉。"},
{"Player", "玩家"},
{"Name", "名字"},
{"The save file's name (up to 8 letters).", "存档名称（最多 8 个字母）。"},
{"Heart Containers (one heart each), from the dungeon bosses.\n\nThe hearts on the HUD update after the next screen change.", "心之容器（每个一颗心），来自地下城首领。\n\n状态栏的心形会在下次切换画面后更新。"},
{"Pieces of Heart: every 4 make a heart.\n\nThe hearts on the HUD update after the next screen change.", "心之碎片：每 4 个合成一颗心。\n\n状态栏的心形会在下次切换画面后更新。"},
{"Health", "生命"},
{"%g hearts", "%g 颗心"},
{"Link's current health, in quarter hearts.", "林克当前生命值，以四分之一心为单位。"},
{"Rupees in Link's wallet (up to 999).\n\nHold left / right to go faster.", "林克钱包中的卢比（最多 999）。\n\n按住左/右可加快调整。"},
{"Secret Seashells collected.", "已收集的秘密贝壳。"},
{"Golden Leaves for Richard.", "给理查德的金色叶子。"},
{"Red + Blue", "红色 + 蓝色"},
{"Tunics", "外衣"},
{"The tunics from the Color Dungeon: red doubles Link's attack, blue halves the damage he takes.", "色彩地下城的外衣：红色使林克攻击力翻倍，蓝色使承受伤害减半。"},
{"Equipment", "装备"},
