{"Link's shield. The Mirror Shield blocks beams and fire.", "林克的盾。镜盾可以抵挡光束和火焰。"},
{"Lifts pots and rocks. Level 2 lifts the heavy ones.", "举起罐子和石头。等级 2 可以举起重物。"},
