{"Pegasus Boots: dash.", "天马靴：冲刺。"},
{"The Ocarina. Songs are under Ocarina songs.", "陶笛。歌曲位于“陶笛歌曲”下。"},
{"Flippers: swim and dive.", "蛙鞋：游泳和潜水。"},
{"Secret Medicine: revives Link once when his health runs out.", "秘密药水：林克生命耗尽时复活一次。"},
{"The Sleepy Toadstool for the witch.", "给女巫的瞌睡蘑菇。"},
