{"Copy them: the setup copies the game data into LAS Recomp's folder - your folder can be moved or deleted afterwards.\n\nUse them in place: the game reads its data from your folder (its romfs/ or romfs.bin), no copy - it saves the space and the wait. It needs the permission to access all files (Android asks), and the folder must stay where it is: moved or deleted, the game files have to be set up again.", "复制文件：安装过程会把游戏数据复制到 LAS Recomp 自己的文件夹 —— 之后你的文件夹可以移动或删除。\n\n就地使用：游戏直接从你的文件夹（其中的 romfs/ 或 romfs.bin）读取数据，不做复制 —— 省下空间与等待时间。这需要「访问所有文件」权限（Android 会询问），且文件夹必须留在原处：一旦移动或删除，就必须重新设置游戏文件。"},
