{"How sharp the 3D image is. Match display: your screen's own resolution. Dynamic: as sharp as your GPU keeps at full speed. 1x-4x: the Switch's 1080p times that. 75% / 50% / 25%: a share of the display, for slower machines.", "3D 画面的清晰度。匹配屏幕：使用屏幕本身的分辨率。动态：在 GPU 能跑满速的前提下尽量清晰。1x–4x：Switch 的 1080p 乘以该倍数。75% / 50% / 25%：按屏幕比例缩放，适合性能较弱的设备。"},
{"How the image is scaled up to the window when it renders at a lower resolution. AMD FSR 1: edge-aware upscaling and sharpening, sharper. Snapdragon GSR 1: Qualcomm's upscaler made for phones, in a single pass - sharp edges, lighter on the GPU. Bilinear: plain and soft.", "以较低分辨率渲染后，画面放大到窗口所用的算法。AMD FSR 1：边缘感知放大并锐化，更清晰。Snapdragon GSR 1：高通为手机设计的单次放大，边缘锐利、GPU 负担更轻。双线性：普通且偏柔和。"},
