{"The base release (1.0.0) stays while other versions are installed.", "安装其他版本时，基础版本（1.0.0）会保留。"},
{"The folder with your own game folders (exefs/romfs) of The Legend of Zelda: Link's Awakening for Nintendo Switch. The game isn't included with LAS Recomp.", "存放你自己导出的 Nintendo Switch《塞尔达传说：织梦岛》游戏文件夹（exefs/romfs）的目录。LAS Recomp 不包含游戏本体。"},
{"The game files folder was moved or can't be read", "游戏文件夹已被移动或无法读取"},
{"The game runs in steps of a 60 Hz clock: at 60 fps one step per frame, at 30 fps two. Auto: the game picks, as on the Switch, and drops to 30 where 60 doesn't fit. 30 fps: targets a fixed 30; actual performance depends on your device and settings. 60 fps: always 60 - where a frame takes longer, the game runs in slow motion (it can't run above 60: it would speed up).", "游戏以 60 Hz 时钟为步进：60 fps 时每帧一步，30 fps 时每帧两步。自动：由游戏自行决定（与 Switch 相同），跑不动 60 时降到 30。30 fps：固定目标 30，实际表现取决于设备与设置。60 fps：始终锁定 60 —— 若单帧耗时过长，游戏会变慢（无法超过 60，否则会加速）。"},
{"The game runs on the system's driver, lighting included. On Adreno GPUs, Mesa's Turnip driver runs it at 60 fps: choose a Turnip driver package (.zip, as for adrenotools).", "游戏使用系统驱动运行，光照效果完整。在 Adreno GPU 上，Mesa 的 Turnip 驱动可跑到 60 fps：请选择一个 Turnip 驱动包（.zip，与 adrenotools 所用相同）。"},
{"The game's text language, as its own system setting. Applies when the game restarts: Quit -> Title screen, then Play.", "游戏的文本语言，相当于主机自身的系统语言设置。游戏重启后生效：退出 -> 标题画面，再开始游戏。"},
{"The game's volume. 100% is the recommended level; above it, louder.", "游戏音量。100% 为推荐值，调高会更响。"},
{"The app's menus and the start screen change at once. Auto follows the phone's language; a language without a UI translation uses English.", "应用菜单和启动界面会立即切换。自动模式跟随手机系统语言；没有界面翻译的语言显示英文。"},
{"The stick stays where the layout puts it. Off: it starts wherever your thumb lands on the left of the screen.", "摇杆固定在布局设定的位置。关闭：摇杆基点会出现在屏幕左侧拇指落下的位置。"},
{"The system's driver from the next start on. Restart LAS Recomp to use it.", "从下次启动起使用系统驱动。重启 LAS Recomp 后生效。"},
{"This GPU: %s", "此 GPU：%s"},
{"Those files can't be used", "这些文件无法使用"},
{"Thunder Drum", "雷鼓"},
{"Translates the game's shaders with 32-bit address math, the path used for drivers without 64-bit integers. Try it if lighting, grass or text are missing or wrong on your GPU. Applies to shaders translated from now on: restart the app for all of them.", "用 32 位地址运算翻译游戏着色器，这是不支持 64 位整数的驱动所用的路径。若你的 GPU 上出现光照、草地或文字缺失/异常，可尝试开启。仅对之后翻译的着色器生效：重启应用可让全部着色器重新翻译。"},
{"Turn on Touch controls (Video tab) to edit the layout.", "请先在「画面」标签页开启触屏按键，才能编辑布局。"},
{"Turnip low-resolution Z (LRZ)", "Turnip 低分辨率 Z（LRZ）"},
{"Turnip's early depth test, a little faster. Off can fix missing or broken drawing on some Adreno GPUs. Automatic: on for Adreno 7xx and 8xx GPUs, off for the others. Applies when LAS Recomp restarts.", "Turnip 的早期深度测试，速度略快。在部分 Adreno GPU 上关闭可修复画面缺失或绘制错乱。自动：Adreno 7xx / 8xx 开启，其他 GPU 关闭。重启 LAS Recomp 后生效。"},
{"Use the system driver", "使用系统驱动"},
{"Use them in place", "就地使用"},
{"Vulkan driver", "Vulkan 驱动"},
{"Waiting for the save picker / transferring saves...", "正在等待存档选择器 / 传输存档…"},
{"What fills the screen around a picture narrower (or taller) than it - movies, menus, the file select, Original 16:9: the picture's own edges, blurred and dimmed, or plain black.", "当画面比屏幕窄（或矮）时，周围区域填充什么 —— 过场动画、菜单、选档界面、原生 16:9 都会遇到：可选画面自身边缘的模糊暗化，或纯黑。"},
{"Which one, for items with several: Pieces of Heart, Secret Seashells, Golden Leaves etc. each have an index.\n\nFor Small Keys, Nightmare Keys, maps, compasses and Stone Beaks: the dungeon (1-8, Color Dungeon 9). Any: the dungeon Link is in.", "对于有多个的道具，指定是哪一个：心之碎片、秘密贝壳、金叶等各自带编号。\n\n小钥匙、噩梦钥匙、地图、罗盘和石喙：指定迷宫（1–8，彩色迷宫为 9）。任意：林克当前所在的迷宫。"},
{"Wind Marimba", "风之木琴"},
{"Writes what the app reports (GPU, driver, errors) to lasrecomp-log.txt in a folder you choose (create one, e.g. Download/LASRecomp), to open on the phone and send with a bug report. Turn it on and play until the problem shows; after a crash, the run before is kept as lasrecomp-log-previous.txt.", "把应用输出的信息（GPU、驱动、错误）写入你选定文件夹中的 lasrecomp-log.txt（可先新建，例如 Download/LASRecomp），便于在手机上查看并随问题报告一起提交。开启后玩到问题复现；崩溃后，上一次运行的日志会保留为 lasrecomp-log-previous.txt。"},
