{"Sets up another release of the game (1.0.0, 1.0.1 or 1.1.0) from its own folder, next to the ones here: PLAY ‹ › on the start screen then switches between them. Each release takes its own space and builds its own game code once; saves are shared. The same release set up again replaces its copy.", "从各自的文件夹设置游戏的其他版本（1.0.0、1.0.1 或 1.1.0），与这里的版本并列：在起始画面用「开始游戏」‹ › 即可在它们之间切换。每个版本各自占用空间，并单独构建一次游戏代码；存档共用。再次设置同一版本会替换它自己的副本。"},
